      {
        "id": 158269,
        "name": "Estelindis",
        "username": "Estelindis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/estelindis/{size}/2017_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-07T18:37:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the info, Bobbert!</p><p>Dpt, I believe the copyright notice should remain, since Legacy and Sentinel Comics are part of GtG's intellectual property.&nbsp; That said, in the versions used for printing, I think it's enough to have copyright on the front of the card only, just like the artist credit.&nbsp; That follows the format that GtG use in their printed cards.</p><p>I have made the incap power text bigger on the version that uses Peter's suggested power.&nbsp; I will now do the same for the other suggested power.&nbsp; Unless anyone has any further suggestions, I will just do a few little things to improve overall quality and leave it there.</p>",
        "post_number": 121,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:38:21.457Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
