      {
        "id": 158270,
        "name": "Estelindis",
        "username": "Estelindis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/estelindis/{size}/2017_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-09T01:03:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I finally finished it!&nbsp; I'm happy with this as the final version.&nbsp; I made the size of the text and power box as close as I possibly could to standard printed cards.&nbsp; Then I tweaked a few aspects of the art, especially the crossword, e.g. trying to make the handwriting look a bit more like the front side, and fitting in a few more Baron Blade-related words (though this mostly can't be seen behind Legacy).&nbsp; As per my previous comments, I've removed artist credit and copyright, solely because printed cards don't have that on the back, and with full admiration for Adam's artistic talent and GtG's intellectual property.&nbsp; <a href=\"http://imgur.com/a/z6J9o\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">There's a full album with both versions here, the regular powers suggested by Peter and the modified powers suggested by bobbertoriley.</a></p><p>![](upload://24I7EgNzK7LTURy2q4U4TXjxXEp.jpeg)</p>",
        "post_number": 122,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-13T06:29:42.445Z",
