        "created_at": "2016-04-05T23:30:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really loved watching this all play out even tho i didnt have an account then. I -snapped- at the morse code thing, but I loved showing my friend (another SotM fan) a month after it was done. And I quote: \"Aaagggghhh. This is soo haaard. I love it! Wait what about Obliv\"-tiptaptiptap. Thanks Peter forcreating such an awesome ARG and for the look on my friend's face when he solved it. He hated himself for not thinking of it sooner. His face was a lot like Cleverest Legacy's as he yelled \"Goddamnit!\"</p><p>Also kudos for everyone who made incap sides.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
